    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the logs are just diagnostic stuff, not part of the actual city reconstructions. and the textures are just files, we can always resupply them if we have to. the storage limit is the priority right now so the system doesnt crash. why would deleting them be a problem for the actual reconstruction?",
