      "content": "If the oversight board mandates efficiency, then robust data retention strategies must be in place, suggesting a staged approach rather than a complete purge. Before confirming, please ensure there is a separate, secure backup location for these logs, even if they are classified as metadata. A full rollback due to capacity issues is serious, but losing the reasoning context alongside it is a different, potentially permanent, failure.",
